            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Color scheme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fehler melden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Report a bug"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freie Software unter der GNU GPL v3.0. Nutzen, ändern, weitergeben – nur geänderte Versionen müssen offen bleiben. Kein Tracking, kein Konto.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free software under the GNU GPL v3.0. Use it, change it, share it – only changed versions have to stay open. No tracking, no account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für alles, was UwULock noch nicht kann: zum Beispiel Organisationen verwalten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For everything UwULock can't do yet, such as managing organizations."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gelöschte Einträge in einem eigenen Bereich der Seitenleiste.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deleted items in a section of their own in the sidebar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Größer": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Larger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Haptisches Feedback": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haptic feedback"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hell": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Light"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hinterlegt Passwörter und Passkeys versiegelt für UwULocks AutoFill-Erweiterung; die öffnet sie nur nach Face ID, Touch ID oder dem Gerätecode. Logins mit erneuter Master-Passwort-Abfrage bleiben draußen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leaves passwords and passkeys sealed for UwULock's AutoFill extension, which opens them only after Face ID, Touch ID or the device passcode. Logins that ask for the master password again stay out."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hoch": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "High"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Im Hintergrund sperren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lock in the background"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Importieren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Importieren holt Einträge aus der Export-Datei eines anderen Passwort-Managers. Umziehen holt Einträge, Ordner, Anhänge, Sends und Organisationen aus Bitwarden oder Vaultwarden. Entschlüsselt wird nur auf diesem Gerät.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import brings in items from another password manager's export file. Moving brings items, folders, attachments, Sends and organizations from Bitwarden or Vaultwarden. Decryption happens only on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Importieren …": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Einstellungen → Apps → Safari → Erweiterungen einschalten. Passkeys kommen in Safari aus dieser App.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn it on in Settings → Apps → Safari → Extensions. In Safari, passkeys come from this app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Safari aktivieren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on in Safari"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Safari eingeschaltet. Melde dich in der Erweiterung an; Passkeys kommen in Safari aus dieser App.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On in Safari. Sign in to the extension; in Safari, passkeys come from this app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jetzt sperren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lock now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jetzt synchronisieren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
