    "Kopieren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kopierte Werte verschwinden danach wieder – aber nur, wenn inzwischen nichts anderes kopiert wurde.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copied values disappear again after that – but only if nothing else was copied in the meantime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lizenz": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "License"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lädt …": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loading …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Löschen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Löscht die Anmeldung und die verschlüsselte Kopie des Tresors von diesem Gerät. Auf dem Server bleibt alles, wie es ist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes the login and the encrypted copy of the vault from this device. Everything on the server stays as it is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Master-Passwort ändern": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change master password"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mehr": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "More"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mit dem Computer sperren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lock with the computer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nach so langer Zeit ohne Eingabe sperrt UwULock den Tresor und vergisst alles Entschlüsselte. Beim Beenden ist er immer gesperrt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After this long without input, UwULock locks the vault and forgets everything decrypted. It is always locked when UwULock quits."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Neue Versionen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New versions"
          }
        }
